    body = [=[
=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Bluffnix} in **Muckvix's Junk Shop** located in {z:Lower Jeuno} at (H-9).
* Trade Bluffnix {i:a square of dhalmel leather|Dhalmel Leather|848}, {i:a steel ingot|Steel Ingot|652}, {i:a square of linen cloth|Linen Cloth|826}, and {i:a peridot|Peridot|788}; or a {q:Goblin Stew 880|Goblin Stew 880|Goblin Stew 880}.
** {i:Dhalmel Leather|Dhalmel Leather|848}: AH > Materials > Leathercraft
** {i:Steel Ingot|Steel Ingot|652}: AH > Materials > Smithing
** {i:Linen Cloth|Linen Cloth|826}: AH > Materials > Clothcraft
** {i:Peridot|Peridot|788}: AH > Materials > Goldsmithing
* After trading the items, your {p:Gobbiebag} capacity will be increased by 5 slots to a new total of 35.

=3 Notes
* If you have a {p:Mog Satchel}, it is also upgraded immediately to the same maximum capacity.
* If you have a {p:Mog Sack}, talk to an {n:Artisan Moogle} and ask for an upgrade after completing this quest to increase your Mog Sack capacity by 5 as well.
* If you do not yet have a Mog Satchel and/or Mog Sack but you acquire one later, it is automatically upgraded to the maximum capacity of your Gobbiebag.

